  "display_title": "Secret Life of My Boss",
  "description": "I used to have these amazing superpowers! They made me famous—but then, out of the blue, poof! I lost them right before a TV appearance. Ever since then, I’ve been so… ordinary. I even got a normal office job. But I’ve got a new boss, who seemed boring, but he has his own extraordinary powers (and is quite popular with men)! At first, I just wanted to know more, but one thing led to another… we got naked, we keep getting naked. Now, I just can’t quit him. How far is this going to go??\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
